      <p class="msc-section-kicker">Bitcoin Ecosystem</p>
      <h1>Bitcoin Artists and the Culture They Shape</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin culture is not one official style or political identity. Artists, designers, filmmakers, musicians, writers, photographers, meme-makers, archivists, and local communities give the technical system symbols, stories, criticism, humor, and historical memory. Their influence can be substantial, but culture, popularity, market price, intellectual property, and protocol consensus remain separate.</p>
